CO STARTING
   TITLEONE  AERMOD Test Case - Lovett Complex Terrain Study
   TITLETWO  Includes both ELEV and FLAT source
   MODELOPT  CONC    FLAT  ELEV
   AVERTIME  1  3  8  24  PERIOD
   POLLUTID  SO2
   RUNORNOT RUN
** EVENTFIL  flatelev_evt.inp
   ERRORFIL  errors.out
